# Extended regexes, one per line, that must each match a line of Logs/server-main.log.
# Each feature can add its own <feature>.expect (and <feature>.commands) next to this file.
Server side started, version [0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+[^,]*, assets loaded
# The one claims switch (step 3): on by default, flipped by an admin and saved.
Claims: Lemuria respects land claims
Claims: set off by .*; Lemuria ignores land claims
Claims: set on by .*; Lemuria respects land claims
